  "releaseNotes": "1.0.2: A search box, sortable Modified columns, markers for components already in the target, a required-components preview, a per-table subcomponent choice, batched copy with progress and Cancel, Publish all, New solution, a yellow note on tables added completely with a confirmation before copying them or model-driven apps, corrected component type numbers, canvas apps and flows grouped by kind, solutions listed newest first, and faster loading. 1.0.1: Author name updated. 1.0.0: First release. Copy components between solutions (with or without required components), paged solution and component loading, readable names for custom component types, and export of failed copies to CSV.",
